Well, here's an example.  You can create a method that takes a question and an array of options, and returns the index of the selected option.  Then, based on the index, you can have different paths in your game.
public static int showMenu(String question, String[] options) {
    System.out.println(question);
    for (int i = 0; i < options.length; i++) {
        System.out.println((i + 1) + ". " + options[i]);
    }
    Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);
    int choice = 0;
    while (choice < 1 || choice > options.length) {
        System.out.print("Enter your choice: ");
        choice = scanner.nextInt();
    }
    return choice;
}

Then, in your game:

